WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:03.587
NATASHA ROMANOFF
You don't know everything about me.

00:00:04.977 --> 00:00:06.977
I've lived a lot
of lives.

00:00:07.002 --> 00:00:08.258
♪♪

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.258
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Before I was an Avenger...

00:00:11.696 --> 00:00:13.696
Before I got this family...

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.943
I made mistakes...

00:00:16.943 --> 00:00:20.146
Choosing between what the
world wants you to be...

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:29.149
And who you are.

00:00:32.144 --> 00:00:35.261
♪♪

00:00:36.699 --> 00:00:37.538
NATASHA ROMANOFF
We have to go back

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:39.138
to where it all started.

00:00:40.251 --> 00:00:42.251
YELENA BELOVA
Where did you think I was all this time?

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:45.899
NATASHA ROMANOFF
We have unfinished business.

00:00:46.354 --> 00:00:47.922
♪♪

00:00:48.821 --> 00:00:50.188
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
My girls...

00:00:50.188 --> 00:00:52.788
...are the toughest
girls in the world.

00:00:55.115 --> 00:00:57.756
MELINA VOSTOKOFF
I'm sorry. We had our orders,

00:00:57.756 --> 00:00:58.920
and we played
our roles.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.085
NATASHA ROMANOFF
It wasn't real.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.145
♪♪

00:01:03.131 --> 00:01:04.796
YELENA BELOVA
It was real to me.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.238
To me...

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.513
...you were everything.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.688
DREYKOV
Bring her...

00:01:15.688 --> 00:01:16.785
...home.

00:01:19.298 --> 00:01:20.588
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Put your seat belts on.

00:01:21.118 --> 00:01:22.457
YELENA BELOVA
You're such a mom.

00:01:22.885 --> 00:01:25.669
♪♪

00:01:35.405 --> 00:01:36.888
NATASHA ROMANOFF
One thing's for sure.

00:01:38.561 --> 00:01:40.726
I'm done running
from my past.

00:01:43.796 --> 00:01:47.482
♪♪

